      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLD GLOBE (2) sharp improver second up when he savaged the line on the firmer surface to run third over 1550m at Randwick Kensington in a Super Maiden. Only has to hold that form in this fairly average contest. MY CARTOUCHE (5) raced closer from the inside draw and finished off strongly when third over 1600m at Wyong. Gets in light again with Chambers' claim and can take a hand in the finish. QUADRIA (6) struck trouble at the start and pressed on to hold a forward position before fading in the straight to finish fifth over 1630m at Wyong. At her top for this and gets another chance from the inside draw. MISS BINMAN (4) gripped on late when up in trip on the firmer surface to finish third over 1750m at Muswellbrook. Drops further in weight and no shock to see her go close.",
